Examples:
    translate --to hi                 # Start, then enter commands
    translate --to fr --off           # Original voice until "on"
    translate --model gemini-3.8-live --to ta
    translate --test                  # Test Gemini without opening audio devices
    translate --usage                 # Print current-process usage (zero at launch)
    translate --set-key               # Prompt for new API key, save to script .env

In-app: help, status, on, off, lang CODE, model NAME, echo on|off,
        key [save], test, usage (cost), input [NAME], quit.
"""
